  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Chop cauliflower (including the stalk) into small florets. Place cauliflower on the lined oven tray.\n• Add Thai spice blend, drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a83140c03460274427ac28/step-18c0672f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, bring the water to the boil in a medium saucepan.\n• Add the basmati rice and a pinch of salt, stir, cover with a lid and reduce the heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a83140c03460274427ac28/step-0c3c32fd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine slaw mix, mayonnaise and a drizzle of white wine vinegar. Toss to coat and season to taste.\n• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a small bowl, combine garlic, honey and soy sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a83140c03460274427ac28/step-59458ba1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Add roasted cauliflower and honey-soy mixture. Cook, stirring, until slightly thickened, 3-4 mins.\n• Divide rice, cauliflower and slaw between bowls. Top with any sauce from pan.\n• Sprinkle with crushed peanuts to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a83140c03460274427ac28/step-1b521a60.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
